miers blocs sont composés respectivement de 3 et 2 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Le renforcement régulier améliore ta performance en course, prévient dans une certaine mesure des blessures, mais c'est surtout un investissement primordial pour ta santé ! Je sais que ça vend moins du rêve qu'un RP sur 10km, mais c'est important de le rappeler.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"wEJw8kcN6TSOZ2k7EYrOxnzFlrfkS3XX","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 1 pied","description":"","variationType":"standard","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394758-dsc4263.png","muxPlaybackId":"1R00Rw81qTAo69DGhdMVO1ZhipUK5euzU","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://image.mux.com/dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte/thumbnail.jpg","muxPlaybackId":"dlCXEee8u01EZxzO1zB7raAYosslztFte","format":"mobile"}]},{"name":"Extension Mollet à 1 pied avec charge additionnelle","description":"","variationType":"advanced","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394833-dsc4270.png","muxPlaybackId":"4IWQj9FusbAG6rA2bIJd6kf3gJzgQCEn","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://