 plus en forme possible pour la prochaine séance !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S60_600_3","description":"Séance de seuil 60' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 5'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 60 : \"Le GROG\"","coachAdvice":"Une séance qui reste assez abordable ! Pour t'aider, je vais te dire comment je définis cette allure quand tu es assez en forme : elle est \"confortablement difficile\" car elle est relativement agréable à courir quand tu ne la tiens pas très longtemps (mais évidemment, en fin de séance, elle deviendra un peu moins confortable avec la fatigue :)).","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S60_5","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 60","value":255,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil60"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name