ndex":3,"weekDate":1788134400000,"sport":"ppg","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":90},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"S'il y a un moment où tu peux travailler ta technique de course, c'est bien en footing ! Prends le temps de penser à un détail que tu souhaites améliorer (voir ici pour 10 points techniques intéressants : https://youtu.be/pP7TCO3kqoM) et concentre toi dessus. Pas sur plusieurs, sur un seul à la fois pour que ce soit vraiment efficace !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_85_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif de 28' en continu est composé de 10' d'endurance active, 15' Tempo et 3' au Sweetspot pour terminer.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"La sortie longue continue d'augmenter de quelques minutes, on est toujours dans une durée qui doit être facile grâce à la progression de la distance semaine après semaine. Si c'est le cas, tant mieux, tu suis exactement la progression désirée ! Sinon, peut-être que tu as couru un peu plus vite que prévu ? 5 ou 10 secondes /km trop vite sur ces durées, ça commence logiquement à se faire sentir donc si c'est ton cas, attention ! :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Aerobie_10","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Aerobie","value":318,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"aerobie"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value