kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Même en 3ème semaine de cycle d'entraînement, là où la fatigue est à son maximum, cette sortie devrait commencer à devenir facile à ce stade. Les jambes sont peut-être lourdes avec les séances bien intenses que tu fais, mais ton corps devient de plus en plus capable de faire avec. C'est signe que tu progresses !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_90_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries de 15' Tempo, séparées par 2' de repos.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Les 1h30 d'effort qu'on te propose aujourd'hui vont continuer de bien développer ton endurance en vue de ton objectif. Essaye encore une fois de courir relâché(e) et de finir ta sortie en ayant l'impression d'en avoir encore sous le pied !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_45","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_15","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_11","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":11,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a67229e24561a45f7ce7d07","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1788739200000,"sessionIndex":5,"choRecommendation":4,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"YbBFRyt1QkiVKE6SJD1x-Q","name":"Compote de pommes énergétique","form":"semi-liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":2,"metric":"item"},"cho":{"value":54,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":2,"metric":"mg"}}},{"datoId":"UcYsNX-mTmaYXlFoDFwiAg","name":"Purée énergétique salée pommes de terre","form":"semi-liquid","info":{"quantity":{"va